    "title": "POSH \u2013 Live Experiences",
    "description": "Connect with an ecosystem of 1M+ eventgoers and organizers. Discover live events and more on the premier platform for finding and creating incredible experiences.\r\n\r\nDISCOVER NEARBY EVENTS\r\n\u2022 Browse local events and experiences in an immersive audiovisual experience.\r\n\u2022 Get the vibe for each event by seeing who's playing and who's going.\r\n\u2022 Purchase tickets, RSVP, and share with your friends in seconds.\r\n\u2022 Access your tickets for when you arrive.\r\n\r\nCREATE AND MANAGE YOUR OWN EVENTS\r\n\u2022 Create stunning event pages in seconds. Customize color, imagery, music, and more.\r\n\u2022 Set permissions, create different types of tickets, and lock events to approved guests only.\r\n\u2022 Sell tickets and jumpstart your organizer career with our CRM and marketing tools built for live experiences.\r\n\u2022 Create tracking links to get insights into your marketing efforts and attribute orders to your affiliates.\r\n\u2022 Scan tickets with ease for seamless door management.\r\n\u2022 Manage your finances with payouts for your account.",
